  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance to Rohingya and Host Communities in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposal outlines activity plan for 19-months project, with the overall objective of promoting the dignity of vulnerable Rohingya and host communities through increased access to protection and humanitarian assistance. IOM plans to implement Protection, Health, Site Management and Site Development (SMSD), Shelter and Non-Food Items (NFI), Water, Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) and Needs and Population Monitoring (NPM) programming in Cox&apos;s Bazar.</narrative>
  </description>
